crystalizer audio filter (src/audio/crystalizer.ts)

src/audio/crystalizer.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_crystalizer.c: the i
(float intensity, [-10,10]) and c (bool clipping) options, the forward
sample-difference recurrence for i >= 0 and the inverse recurrence for i < 0,
the optional av_clipf/av_clipd clip to [-1,1], the one-sample per-channel
previous-value frame carried across input frames, and the native sample-format
list {flt, fltp, dbl, dblp} from FILTER_SAMPLEFMTS.

